Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.87,0:00:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然没告诉我  我们还是夫妻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I cannot believe that you didn't tell me we are still married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.63,0:00:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这不是正准备告诉你么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I was going to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候   第一个私生子出生后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When? After the birth of our first secret child?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯没办注销   我们还是夫妻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross didn't get the annulment. We are still married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.85,0:00:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're kidding? Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.93,0:00:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这个决定不太好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, maybe it wasn't my best decision...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我无法面对另一次失败婚姻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I couldn't face another failed marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我插个嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me just jump in and ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这段婚姻哪里成功了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}At what point did you think this was a successful marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  别这样  其实想想  还蛮好笑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, come on. If you think about it, it's actually kind of funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是不要想好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, maybe it's best not to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是不可原谅   我真是震惊到了极点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, this is inexcusable. I'm shocked to my very core.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我已经说你知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, I told her you already knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又在骗人  你真的有病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Another lie. You have a sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.31,0:01:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯   我只是随便问问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, just for my own peace of mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没娶我们其他人吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you're not married to any more of us, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第六季  第5集  名车狂想曲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S06E05  The One With Joey's Porsche
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.69,0:01:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.07,0:01:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.36,0:01:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.66,0:01:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人掉了钥匙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, someone left their keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是保时捷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, to a Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿甘  这是你的吗   是啊  我开保时捷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Gunther, are these yours? Yeah. That's what I drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.23,0:01:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我时薪4块钱   存了350年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I make 4 bucks an hour. I saved up for 350 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  有人掉钥匙了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, did anybody lose their keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以放进失物招领箱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, why don’t you put them in the lost and found?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有失物招领箱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a lost and found?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的鞋子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My Shoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.67,0:02:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你掉了一只鞋在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You left a shoe here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.59,0:02:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我回到家才发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I didn't realize till I got home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要光着一只脚再回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wasn't gonna walk all the way back down here with one shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去找那辆车  然后留言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna go find that guy's car and leave a note on the windshield.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.06,0:02:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等他来了  我会把你的鞋子给他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good. When he comes back for his keys, I'll be sure to give him your shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.89,0:02:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  你们在这里  听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good, good. You guys are here. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天起要不要一起照顾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How would you like to spend tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.65,0:02:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三只超可爱的小狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...taking care of three incredibly cute little puppies?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.40,0:02:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好棒啊  听起来好好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. What a fun day. That sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.78,0:02:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我明早带他们过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, well, I'll bring them by tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.37,0:02:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  其实不是小狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, and by the way, they're not actually puppies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是法兰克的三胞胎  好  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're Frank and Alice's triplets. Okay, see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, whoa, whoa. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.29,0:02:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  法兰克他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, please, please? Frank and Alice...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托我带小孩  我好紧张  我一个人没带过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...asked me to baby sit the triplets and I’m nervous ‘cause I’ve never done that before by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.09,0:03:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放心  菲比  我们一定会帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don’t worry about it Phoebe, we’ll absolutely do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就不了  如果是狗狗我就很犹豫了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm gonna pass, because I was kind of iffy when it was puppies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  钱德  这是练习的好机会啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Chandler. Come on, it'll give us great practice for when...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总会有客人带小孩来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...people with babies come to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it's, uh-It's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你的车  它是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love your car. Yeah. It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定很能跑  我想也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I bet it's fast. Me too. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且很舒服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢皮椅吗  喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you, uh, like leather seats? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它有皮椅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里还有我的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, I still have boxes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯家也有我的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I still have boxes at Ross'.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:03:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我却没地方住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I have nowhere to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.81,0:03:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在应该要发狂才对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, I could so easily freak out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:04:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚发现狄妮丝要出远门  我没室友了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just found out Denise is leaving town for a while. I don't have a roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我可以当你的室友  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe I could be your roommate, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也对啊  可以啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you could be my roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有办法了  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, there's an idea. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That would be great. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狄妮丝要去多久  她说她12月26日回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, how long is Denise gone for? Um, she said she'd be back December 26th.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,12月26日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! December 26th.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许她是圣诞老公公\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh, maybe she's Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.18,0:04:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看  是谁  我老公  我的心肝宝贝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, look who it is. My husband, the apple of my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经约好明天2点出庭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I got us a court date for tomorrow at 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,表格也都拿了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I picked up all the forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会搞定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然   既然你说你会搞定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure, if you say you're gonna take care of everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当然没理由怀疑你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I have no reason to doubt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿来啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give me those forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我要照我的方式去做  你不准叽叽歪歪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, now, I'm gonna do this my way, and I don't wanna hear a peep out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  但是  你在叽叽歪歪嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Rash, but--Ah, you're peeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我实在是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, you know what? I just got--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要这样  我说过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why did you do this? Look, I told you--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想听 "三次失败的婚姻"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't wanna hear "three failed marriages."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你失败过两次  就会了解了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, if you'd had two failed marriages, you'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了你   我现在只差一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you know what? Thanks to you, I'm half way there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我快气死了  罗斯  我从来没有这么气过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I am so mad, Ross. I don't think I've ever been this angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说我们分手了的那次呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about the time I said we were on a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你那边怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还好  你觉得他们开心吗  我讲话太快了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm doing okay. Do you think they're having fun? Am I talking too fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会  跟我差不多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. You sound like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都很好  你看钱德和小女生钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's going great. Look at Chandler with Little Baby Girl Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小女生钱德   我在哪里听过   对了  鲁本教练\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Little Baby Girl Chandler. Where have I heard that before? Oh, right, Coach Rubin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what, Pheebs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等你那边忙完  我们这里也有状况了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When you're done over there, we've got a kind of situation over here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  自己的小孩要自己照顾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-uh. No. We are all responsible for our own babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就错了  我们一直采取人盯人战术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, that's where I think you're wrong. We've been playing them man-to-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.99,0:06:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们应该打区域联防的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We should really be playing a zone defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得一人守一区\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just think things will go smoother...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会比较顺畅   菲比  你可以负责擦屁屁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...if we each have our own zone, you know? Phoebe, you can be in charge of wiping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你负责包尿布\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, Mon, you can be in charge of diapering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就负责看他们抓着我的手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I can be in charge of looking at how cute they are when they put their hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好主意  也许你才应该擦屁屁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That sounds really great, but you should be in charge of wiping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是菜鸟   不该守球门区\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'm a rookie. I should not be in the end zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊哦  真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, this is so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,餐厅都应该这样准备餐点的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is exactly how we set the plates at the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  我可不是点的这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah? Well, this is not what I ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝们好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.33,0:06:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早上真过瘾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm having the best morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙在我这儿的那辆保时捷  还在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That, uh, Porsche I've got the keys to? Still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧  毕竟钥匙在你手上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shocking, since you still have the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该看看  大家对我的态度\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You should see the treatment I get when I'm with that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都很友善  找我聊天  而且不只是聊车子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}People are friendly. They wanna talk. And not just about the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有人教我投资策略\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One guy advised me on my equity investments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么投资策略\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What equity investments?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.85,0:07:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赚到保时捷的股票投资  你跟上好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The ones that got me the Porsche. Will you keep up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但要是我光杵在那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I figured, if people keep seeing me just standing there...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别人会觉得那不是我的车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...they're gonna start to think I don't own it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我要洗车  摩妮卡  你有水桶和肥皂吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I figure I'll wash it, right? Monica, you got a bucket and some soap?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  我有肥皂  海绵  抹布\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. I got soap and sponges and rags...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亮光腊和打腊工具组\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and carnauba wax and polishing compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本没有车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't even have a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  但是有一次  楼下停过一辆很脏的车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. But one time there was this dirty car parked in front of the building...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就把它给洗了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so I washed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢  还有另外六辆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And? And six others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:08:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它可以飙到130\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, she tops out at 130. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.64,0:08:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这还是在市内  出了市区到上州可以飙到160\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's just in the city. I get her up to 160 upstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  你在上州也有房子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? You got a place upstate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,改天见  好  慢走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'll see you later. Okay. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.11,0:08:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  那是我的车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. That's my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.45,0:08:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再给我5分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just give me five more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.33,0:08:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我捡到钥匙  现在帮它打腊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I found the keys, and now I'm just polishing her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这是我的车  这是我的腊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it's my car. Yeah, but it's my wax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我很少进市区\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I don't come to the city much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你是疯子  还是在演街头剧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I don't know if you're crazy or if this is some kind of street theater...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但请把钥匙还给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but could I have my keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去  我帮你占了车位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. Yeah. I'll save your parking spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  我住在上州\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why not? I live upstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我本来也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, so did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我之前不晓得在紧张什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know why I was so nervous about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.11,0:08:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,法兰克他们为什么会抱怨  带孩子太容易了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I don't know why Frank and Alice are always complaining. This is so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.45,0:09:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  2小时和一辈子能一样嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, two hours, a lifetime, that's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看  宝宝醒来后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Check it out. Check it out. When the babies wake up...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.00,0:09:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以认识克洛格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...they can meet Krog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么   那个东西会害人的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing? That thing could put someone's eye out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不止害人  他还能毁灭宇宙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He can do more than that. He can destroy the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  钱德  宝宝可能会误食那些零件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Chandler, they could swallow one of those little parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  那个光滑的部位  会误导他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And also, look at his smooth area. That's just gonna mess them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们才不会误食什么  你们这叫保护过度\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're not gonna swallow anything. You're too overprotective.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候   我妈都把我扔在碎玻璃堆里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I was a kid, my mom used to just throw me into a pile of broken glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.19,0:09:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  玻璃  沙子  还不都一样嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Glass, sand, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.57,0:09:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小莱丝莉边睡边伸懒腰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, look at little Leslie stretching in her sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.37,0:09:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道要到几岁  才没办法把腿举到头上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wonder what age it is when you stop putting both legs behind your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在还是可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I can still do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会还没结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How are you still single?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   我想或许你们说得对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, ahem. I thought about it, and maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许克洛格不够安全\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe Krog is not a safe toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.05,0:10:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么改口了  我吞了音波死光枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. What made you change your mind? I swallowed his sonic blaster gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想证明我是对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I was trying to prove that I was right, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.89,0:10:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果   我错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it turns out I was wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在它还卡在我的喉咙里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and now it's lodged in my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的  我们光顾着带小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn it, this whole time we were concentrating on the babies...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都忘了要看着钱德了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and no one was watching Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位  要申请注销婚姻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you two are asking the court for an annulment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  申请表  都填好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, Your Honor. And here are our forms, all filled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根据申请书所言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So based on your petition...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你申请注销的理由是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you are seeking an annulment on the grounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖勒先生的精神状况不稳定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that "Mr. Geller is mentally unstable."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我精神状况不稳定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. I'm mentally unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.77,0:10:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  他使用静脉注射毒品\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And based on the fact that "Mr. Geller is an intravenous drug user."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  是的  海洛因与快克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Uh, yes. Heroin and crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快克根本不是静脉注射毒品\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Crack isn't even an intravenous drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当然知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you would know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.07,0:11:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这上面还说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, it also says here that you:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"你在婚前隐瞒性向"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Lied about your sexual preference before marriage."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  罗斯  我发现那些杂志了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on. Ross, please. I found the magazines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.29,0:11:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  你"无法履行夫妻间的义务"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, finally, that you were "unable to consummate the marriage."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也难怪  你是同志  又打海洛因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that makes sense since you're gay and addicted to heroin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  这也太夸张了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you know, I'm sorry, this is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有打海洛因  我不是同志\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not addicted to heroin, I'm not gay, and there is no problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我履行什么都没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with my ability to consummate anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.48,0:11:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就可以在这里履行  现在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I'll consummate this marriage right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有这个必要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们交往时  简直跟兔子有得一拼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And when we were dating, we consummated like bunnies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们曾经认真交往  那就有问题了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, if you two were involved in a serious relationship, that really creates a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大人  我们2年前就分手了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your Honor, rest assured, that relationship ended two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以删掉 "跟兔子有得一拼" 吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And can you please strike "consummated like bunnies" from the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这份申请书有任何实话吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is there anything in this record that is actually true?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  我们确实在赌城结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well, yes. We got married in Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,名字应该也没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, the names, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.76,0:12:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但从刚才的话来听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, based on what I've heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.51,0:12:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位不符合注销资格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you two certainly don't qualify for an annulment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们不想在一起   就必须办理离婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you don't wanna be together, you'll have to file for divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  你高兴了吗  都是你的搞笑表格害的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great. You happy now? Look what you did with your funny, funny form.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.28,0:12:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我的表格   你那句"跟兔子有得一拼"呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Me? What about you and your "consummated like bunnies" nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那  你打什么打\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what--? What are you typing that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没听到嘛  我们不能办注销了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She already said we don't get the annulment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要打了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't type that. What--?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再打了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop typing. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再打了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop typing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.38,0:12:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别打了  "别打了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop typing, "stop typing"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看你  让我嫁的是什么人啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, do you see what you're keeping me married to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请两位离开我的办公室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You need to get out of my chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你给我听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, lady, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来办注销的  没办成我绝对不走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I came here for an annulment, and I'm not leaving here until I get one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们想在牢里过夜吗   耽误您了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you like to spend the night in jail? Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保时捷的主人把车开走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That Porsche guy took his car back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你捡到的是他的衣橱钥匙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you found the keys to his clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是喜欢  大家以为我有保时捷的感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love the way it feels when everybody thinks I own a Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.51,0:13:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你穿这样   别人就会以为你有了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}People would think you own a Porsche because of the clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.31,0:13:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴才会没车还穿成这样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Only an idiot would wear this stuff if he didn't have the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那倒是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过应该只有天才  才会误食音波死光枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but only a genius would swallow a sonic blaster gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也误食过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.62,0:13:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去开我的保时捷了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am gonna go drive my Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   你知道你没有保时捷吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, you know you don't actually have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  你搞什么  我正在入戏   你说说她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. What are you doing? I'm in character. Will you talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉它动了  它真的在戳我啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, I think it just moved. It's really poking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  我们去挂急诊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it. We're going to the emergency room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.97,0:14:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不  你们不能把我扔给他们  我们正在带孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? No, you can't leave me here with them. We're babysitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝都睡了  你撑一下应该没问题啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The babies are asleep. I'm sure you'll be okay on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们不能把我扔给他们  我们是一队的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you can't leave me with them. We're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在打区域联防  他们会以三打一\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're playing a zone. They're gonna triple-team me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的喉咙卡了个塑胶玩具  我们必须去医院啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's got something plastic in his throat. We gotta go to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但医生也帮不了他  反正\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, no, because a doctor won't be able to help him. And it's just gonna, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过个7年就会自动排出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...naturally pass through his system in, like, seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.41,0:14:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是口香糖   我确定是死光枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think that's gum. I'm pretty sure it's gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  真的很痛啊  我们走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, listen, this really hurts. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,男子汉才不会冲去医院\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But no. A real man wouldn't just run to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克洛格会怎么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. What would Krog do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泊车小弟怎么还没  把我的保时捷开来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why isn't that valet back with my Porsche?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许因为钥匙在你手上嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe because you've got the keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是你的错  我的错  你威胁法官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was totally your fault. My fault? You threatened the judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把书记员的打字纸撕下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you ripped the paper out of the court reporter's machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样才能让他打不下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was the only way I could get him to stop typing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖勒夫妇好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. How are the Gellers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要那样叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't call us that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,法官不准我们办注销  我们只能去办离婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The judge wouldn't let us get an annulment. Now we gotta get a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你被保捷附身了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did a Porsche throw up on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.39,0:15:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.81,0:15:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是"保时捷"啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's "Porsche."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全可以照顾你们  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me taking care of you is no problem, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得很安心吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys feel safe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吐泡泡就表示〝安心〞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'm gonna take that spit bubble as a "Yeah, I do."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我扔了脏尿布  就帮你换一块干净的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's get rid of this dirty diaper, Leslie. I'll set you up with a nice clean one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.03,0:15:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我不是故意的  我得先清理一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'm sorry. I didn't mean to scare you. I just have to clean that up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:16:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是摩妮卡的家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because, let's face it, we're at Monica's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,破了  反正东西迟早都会坏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I broke it. All right. Well, that's just the way things go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  就这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么只剩两个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why are there only two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莱丝莉呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where's Leslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.09,0:16:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不会说话  莱丝莉  你在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you can't answer. Leslie? Where are you, Leslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.97,0:16:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莱丝莉  现在是开口说话的好时机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Leslie, now would be a good time for your first words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看看你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有点点调皮喔  真是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are a little bit mischievous. My gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是非常皮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you're a lot mischievous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正会干的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it'll dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去跟哥哥妹妹躺在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you sit with your brother and sister now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...who aren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.84,0:16:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:17:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再过12到14小时  克洛格就又能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, let's just say that Krog will be equipped to destroy the universe again...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毁灭宇宙了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in 12 to 14 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一个人把孩子都带好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so I totally took care of the babies all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂奶  洗澡  哄他们睡觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I fed them, bathed them and put them to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.11,0:17:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还保护他们躲过龙卷风\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And protected them from a tornado?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.03,0:17:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  宝宝都睡了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. The babies are asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  家里是怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做到了  我一个人照顾宝宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did it. I took care of the babies all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我的房子  成了菲比胜利的战场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But my apartment. Was the setting of Phoebe's triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是这里乱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.59,0:17:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比起菲比的辛劳实在不算什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is not as important as the fact that Phoebe took care of the babies all by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  我不该大惊小怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right. You're right, I shouldn't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我们有了孩子  也会这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}‘Cause this is what will happen when you and I have babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那得等到什么时候呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你看你弄得多乱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, would you take a look at this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.49,0:18:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你总算回来了  我都开始担心了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, honey, thank God you're home. I was getting worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去领了离婚证书\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I picked up the divorce papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.25,0:18:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该签的我都签了 你要签的地方我也画了叉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, I've already signed everything. And I put little X's where you need to sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,画叉  真好  这样就前嫌尽释了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, little X's. Great. That makes up for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也干过很多蠢事  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, you've done a lot of stupid stuff too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有哪一件事情跟这次一样蠢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, name one stupid thing that is as stupid as this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.97,0:18:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你飞去伦敦阻止我结婚怎么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, how about you flew to London to stop my wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.68,0:18:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经结婚了  你还说你爱我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about you told me you loved me after I was married?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着  那不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute, that was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做那些事  是因为我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did those things because I was in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  的确很不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right. That's very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之赶快签一签吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So let's just sign the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样  没事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请签名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, can we just sign, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯   等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, wait, Ross. Wait a minute. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.81,0:19:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一件事要坦白\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I, uh, kind of have a little confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  结婚这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well, you know, this whole marriage thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算是我的主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kind of my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.53,0:19:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是醉到那天晚上的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, remember how we were too drunk to remember anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.29,0:19:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事都想不起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the night we were married?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很不想说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And yeah, I didn't really wanna say anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.38,0:19:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我的记忆一直回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but it just kind of kept coming back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记不记得  我们在赌场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, remember, we were in the casino...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你突然觉得   狂吃葡萄会很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and for some reason, you thought it'd be funny to eat a lot of grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我觉得  我们结婚一定会更好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I thought it would be funnier if we got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是我们折衷  先去结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, ahem, as a compromise, we decided first to get married and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.73,0:19:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后再去吃很多葡萄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...(Ross joins in) to eat a lot of grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.65,0:20:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  惹出这些麻烦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry I got us into this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.53,0:20:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  仔细想想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So then, I mean, if you think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.33,0:20:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都是你的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...this is all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要得寸进尺\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, don't push it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.79,0:20:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I gotta say...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟很多女人离过婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I know I divorce a lot of women.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却从来没想过会跟你离婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Never thought I'd be divorcing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.05,0:20:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.76,0:20:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我总觉得要是我们结婚   一定会天长地久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I always thought if you and I got married, that would be the one that stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.31,0:20:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会是秘密结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it wouldn't be a secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.15,0:20:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更不会在必胜客请吃酒席\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and we wouldn't have our wedding dinner at Pizza Hut.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有请客吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did I even treat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  那是免费的  新婚夫妇特惠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it was on the house. It was a newlywed special.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.99,0:20:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没听过这么令人沮丧的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That may be the most depressing thing I've heard in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去律师那里送件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I should probably get these to my lawyer's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  罗斯  把事情都办妥了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, thanks, Ross, for taking care of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:21:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, no problem. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要份副本  没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna need a copy of those. Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.93,0:21:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.65,0:21:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿   别在我的保时捷旁边乱跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey, hey. Careful around my Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Joey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.62,0:21:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.78,0:21:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他有一辆最拉风的保时捷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He has the most amazing Porsche under there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想给你们看看  但我刚刚哄她睡着了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd love to show you, but I just tucked her in. She's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.33,0:21:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  两位  要不要去喝杯酒啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, would you two girls like to go for a drink?
